---
import { resolveAsset } from '../utils/streaming';
const vinylCover = resolveAsset('/assets/hub/closing-vinyl-art.webp');
const base = (import.meta.env.BASE_URL || '/').replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<section class="wrap closing-wrapper" aria-label="Cierre y despedida">
  <div class="closing scroll-reveal">
    <div class="closing-glow-mesh" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="closing-sparkles" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="sparkle s1">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M12 2L14.4 9.6L22 12L14.4 14.4L12 22L9.6 14.4L2 12L9.6 9.6L12 2Z"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <span class="sparkle s2">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <span class="sparkle s3">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <circle cx="12" cy="9" r="6"/>
          <path d="M12 15v7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="closing-layout-grid">
      <div class="closing-content">
        <span class="eyebrow closing-eyebrow">Siguiente parada</span>
        <h2>¿Qué era quieres volver a vivir?</h2>
        <p>
          Explora la discografía interactiva, descubre canciones ocultas de sus álbumes en Corea y Japón, o revive los 10 años de historia de TWICE desde su debut en 2015.
        </p>
        <div class="closing-actions">
          <a class="button closing-btn-primary" href={`${base}/musica`}>
            <span>Explorar discografía</span>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7 17L17 7M7 7h10v10"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a class="button light closing-btn-secondary" href="https://twice.jype.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            <span>Sitio oficial de TWICE ↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Vitrina Visual de Vinilo Giratorio para enriquecer el lado derecho -->
      <div class="closing-visual-showcase" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="closing-vinyl-composition">
          <div class="closing-vinyl-record">
            <div class="closing-vinyl-label">
              <span class="closing-label-text">TWICE</span>
              <span class="closing-label-sub">2015–2025</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="closing-sleeve">
            <img src={vinylCover} alt="" class="closing-sleeve-img" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="closing-sleeve-gloss"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
